{"body":"Python 3 / raw sockets (epoll via `selectors`) / psycopg 3 / bcrypt / PyJWT — `Front: direct`.\n\nHexagonal structure: pure domain rules, Protocol ports, inbound socket-adapter (non-blocking epoll loop with per-connection request buffering and byte-exact keep-alive) and outbound pg/crypto adapters, wired in `main.py`.\n\n- Bounded psycopg pool (5–30) against Postgres `max_connections = 100`\n- All 19 Conduit endpoints per the reference SQL (capped counts, tag/author/favorited filters, lateral-join feed, transactional article+tags insert)\n- Real security: fresh bcrypt cost-10 verify per login, HS256 + `exp` verified on every request, no caching\n- Conformance: **197/197 steps PASS** via `just test`\n\nToolchain: `build.sh` creates a project venv from `constraints.txt` (fully pinned incl. transitives); `install.sh` apt-fetches python3-venv/libpq; `start.sh` runs the foreground server. Justfile recipes: `test`, `venv`, `lint`, `check`, `paths`.","closedAt":null,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-23T18:57:11Z","files":[{"path":"submissions/python-rawsocket-shawal-mbalire/.gitignore","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/python-rawsocket-shawal-mbalire/AGENTS.md","additions":78,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/python-rawsocket-shawal-mbalire/README.md","additions":76,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/python-rawsocket-shawal-mbalire/build.sh","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/python-rawsocket-shawal-mbalire/conduit_server/adapters/inbound/controllers.py","additions":427,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/python-rawsocket-shawal-mbalire/conduit_server/adapters/inbound/errors.py","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/python-rawsocket-shawal-mbalire/conduit_server/adapters/inbound/router.py","additions":156,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submissions/python-rawsocket-shawal-mbalire/c